text: |-
  Brandon Taylor Moore
  @LetsGoBrando45 • 8h
  5 ...
  The Bolshevik Revolution was the first successful communist coup. It's how
  Russia became the Soviet Union.
  The first law they passed was outlawing anti-Semitism.
  They burned over 54,000 churches and killed over 60,000,000 Russian
  Christians.
  They made Hitler, Hitler.
  Hitler portrayed
  Bolshevism as an
  imminent danger
  to Germany's
  sovereignty and
  racial purity,
  warning that "the
  danger to which
  Russia
  succumbed is
  always present for
  Germany."
